22:25.870 --> 22:27.453
If I win,

22:27.966 --> 22:30.572
you only have to see me if
it's about Lottie or money.

22:30.979 --> 22:32.878
That's not what I meant.

22:32.903 --> 22:34.401
Then beat me.

22:37.300 --> 22:39.571
I don't see what this is gonna prove.

22:40.476 --> 22:42.686
